      "text": "I'm gonna read another novel soon. They're my favorite type of book because I get involved with the story, and I feel like I'm living the adventure along with the make-believe characters in the story. I can discuss this next novel with my classmates because they are very interested in the subject of the book, which is time travel. The first chapter of the book begins with an inventor traveling forward in time 100 years. Imagining what he might find can distract me from the everyday responsibilities of life.",
